---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: mer-an-mat.html
title: Mer än mat · Ofta bra efter
description: Hemmaspa, städning och godis till husdjuren, gjort på kaffesump, citrusskal och annat som blev över.
---
  <main id="main" class="wrap archive-page more-page">
    <section class="greeting archive-greeting" aria-labelledby="more-title">
      <div>
        <a class="text-button archive-back" href="receptarkiv.html"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> Till receptarkivet</a>
        <h1 id="more-title"><span class="marker">Mer än mat.</span></h1>
        <p class="greeting-intro">Kaffesump, citrusskal och den sista bananen räcker till mer än middag. Här finns hemmaspa, städning och godis till husdjuren.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="greeting-aside" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="doodle-lineup">
          <img src="assets/icons/towel-and-candle.svg" alt="" width="60" height="60">
          <img src="assets/icons/spray-bottle.svg" alt="" width="60" height="60">
          <img src="assets/icons/dog-bone.svg" alt="" width="60" height="60">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {#- One section per non-food type (spa, household, pets) from collections.recipeTypes, so the label,
        icon and intro are the ones on the type page the heading links to. app.js fills each grid. #}
    {%- for type in collections.recipeTypes %}{% if type.key != 'food' %}

    <section class="more-section" aria-labelledby="more-{{ type.key }}">
      <h2 id="more-{{ type.key }}" class="more-heading"><a href="{{ type.path }}"><img src="assets/icons/{{ type.icon }}.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32"><span>{{ type.label }}&nbsp;<i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right more-heading-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></h2>
      <p class="more-intro">{{ type.intro }}</p>
      <div class="recipe-grid" data-more="{{ type.key }}"></div>
    </section>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </main>
